{
	"name": "Killshot",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/skills/wounds/injury-pain-body-orange.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 18th level, your aim is a thing of legend. When you land a critical hit on an enemy, you can declare a killshot. If the target has less than 100hp they die, immediately. If they have more than 100hp, they instead take 10d10 damage and become stunned until the end of your next turn. A creature targeted by this ability must have a head, a heart, or a similar vital organ or weak spot. If they do not possess such an organ or weak spot, you cannot use this ability.</p><p>Killshot cannot be used in conjunction with abilities that grant automatic critical hits, such as @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.C28axNSk3nP3Zv0P]{Legendary Gunslinger}.</p><p>You may use this ability once per long rest.</p>",
